{"tmdb":1049439,"tagline":"","synopsis":"Born at the turn of the century in a village's butcher shop, Jeanne Lavaur dreams of becoming a countess. Inspired by the fearless Céleste and guided by her love for Guillaume de Barante, Jeanne’s journey carries her from the vibrant Paris of the Golden Twenties through the turmoil of two world wars. As her life intertwines with the great upheavals of the 20th century, she rises as a fiercely free woman, determined to never let anyone else define who she is meant to be.","directors":[{"name":"Bérenger Thouin","id":3789305}],"cast":[{"actor":"Souheila Yacoub","role":"Jeanne Lavaur","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/A233BHgXw0dzbeOpvHfJwL9gLy1.jpg","tmdb":2037046},{"actor":"Vassili Schneider","role":"Guillaume de Barante","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/z2kYjGGgDi0YzMO4OvoWbClgmr4.jpg","tmdb":125839},{"actor":"Pierre-Antoine Billon","role":"","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/mRDgDNlo7VHg4OWJsQwDB75Kgjz.jpg","tmdb":1986148},{"actor":"Yile Yara Vianello","role":"Céleste","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/oqmoWSIlF2eikiGv42rmqEVNi6a.jpg","tmdb":239920},{"actor":"Laïs Mayyas","role":"Eden","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/dfmTojpcNBSWQBgzlMIcvv9XQS8.jpg","tmdb":5265342},{"actor":"Kevin Lissajoux","role":"Joseph Lavaur","photo":null,"tmdb":3412581}],"trailers":[],"official":null,"watch":{},"artwork":{"posters":[["/tuLe4oHdG4wrCsscEpcCxzibBfB.jpg",900,1350]],"backdrops":[["/gQQ7j5t5m2BYhk4gCOQzLccwtes.jpg",3840,2160],["/gqeyu5njNNnFI78Vvu45kPgiFJg.jpg",1920,1080],["/GHasEDP3HeEforqefHmqGw8Lvx.jpg",1920,1080],["/2dR5AiRIN2bnjBLyGtblaEMLuDW.jpg",1920,1080],["/pbl15HnMVN50IwyQKUNL0RvLLL6.jpg",1280,720],["/dpUUNERlP7Mk6qt28SfjtH7SEci.jpg",1280,720],["/rhyZCwbhYfeDaE718rmNjqhl4T9.jpg",1280,720]],"logos":[]}}